    title: >-
      Canonical BAF complex activity shapes the enhancer landscape that
      licenses CD8+ T cell effector and memory fates
    authors:
      - family-names: McDonald
        given-names: "Bryan D."
      - family-names: Chick
        given-names: "Brent Y."
    journal: Immunity
    volume: 56
    issue: 6
    year: 2023
    doi: 10.1016/j.immuni.2023.05.005
    notes: >-
